# The Workshop page's captures 1 to 4 (23-gallery-vanilla.feature): the pass WITHOUT the optional mods, plus the tools of
# the Sanctuary of Nelim, the colony every gallery picture is taken in (fixture Nelims-tribe, mod Nelim's Sanctuary
# Backlot, which the staging adds by itself). The zen meadow studio this map used to mount was deleted on 2026-10-08.
#
# The tools below are the ones wsl-deps.sanctuary.map of PickleTools mounts (screen studio, camera zoom, stage decor,
# clear screen, bundled shell) plus the two this suite's steps need (screenshot mode for @requires, colonist race). None
# of them is a neighbour of Bill Autopilot: none adds a gameplay patch, setting, main button or def, so "without the
# optional mods" keeps its meaning.
#
# Run it with:
#     -DepMap wsl-deps.galerie.map
#
# The path is relative to the collection's root, and the folder PickleTools has to be cloned beside the mods under exactly
# that name; the folder's own About.xml packageId must equal the one written here.
nelim.pickletools.screenshotstudio   path:PickleTools/ScreenshotStudio/Mod
nelim.pickletools.camerazoom         path:PickleTools/CameraZoom/Mod
nelim.pickletools.stagedecor         path:PickleTools/StageDecor/Mod
nelim.pickletools.clearscreen        path:PickleTools/ClearScreen/Mod
nelim.pickletools.screenshotmode     path:PickleTools/ScreenshotMode/Mod
nelim.pickletools.colonistrace       path:PickleTools/ColonistRace/Mod
nelim.pickletools                    path:PickleTools/Tests/Pickle/StandaloneBase/Mod
